                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I can forgive the delay in jumping. \n\nWhat I can't forgive is the way this game handles dying. \n\nAny fall off a platform goes into an animation that plays once and then just sits there. You then have to use your mouse to goto the top left corner and click the restart button, to reload the entire level. I tried mashing every button on my keyboard, but I could not find a keyboard command (like \"R\" in most flash games that do this.)\n\nThat being said, I really enjoy the main mechanic of this game. With a bit more polish, this could be a nice little gem.",
